/// | Endpoint | URL |
/// |----------|-----|
/// | Authorize | `https://auth.kof22.com/application/o/authorize/` |
/// | Token | `https://auth.kof22.com/application/o/token/` |
/// | Revoke | `https://auth.kof22.com/application/o/revoke/` |
