/// | `412` / `428` | Stale or missing `If-Match` on update. |
/// | `413` | Upload or body too large. |
/// | `415` | Unsupported media type. |
/// | `422` | Validation failed. |
/// | `429` | Rate limited; honour `Retry-After`. |
